{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Guns are Funs",
    "steam_appid": 3003640,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/5682719f4a37d1328f7e14c560f31e4f.avif?t=1752324886\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns are Funs is an arcade game that combines elements of a shooter, runner, and tower destruction. Immerse yourself in the world of toy soldiers who wage fierce battles for power and influence in the room. Bright dynamic battles, unique missions, and a variety of game modes await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/308adf6f9ff2a90beeea01029ce9aaac.poster.avif?t=1752324886\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/308adf6f9ff2a90beeea01029ce9aaac.webm?t=1752324886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/308adf6f9ff2a90beeea01029ce9aaac.mp4?t=1752324886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story campaign is divided into chapters, each offering distinct missions that challenge your skills across different aspects of the game. And if you're looking for some non-stop fun without the narrative, dive into the sandbox mode \u2014 where you can explore all game elements and compete for the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/e2dbd4db438b47d400ac345ff5666295.poster.avif?t=1752324886\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/e2dbd4db438b47d400ac345ff5666295.webm?t=1752324886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/e2dbd4db438b47d400ac345ff5666295.mp4?t=1752324886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your army of toys, crush your enemies' towers, and prove that even the smallest soldiers can become the greatest heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/d66ab97db8f1c3cb34b6e31ad688b2b2.poster.avif?t=1752324886\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/d66ab97db8f1c3cb34b6e31ad688b2b2.webm?t=1752324886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/d66ab97db8f1c3cb34b6e31ad688b2b2.mp4?t=1752324886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Vibrant 3d graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Exciting and funny plot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Comic cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Different game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Author's musical accompaniment</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/5682719f4a37d1328f7e14c560f31e4f.avif?t=1752324886\" width=616 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns are Funs is an arcade game that combines elements of a shooter, runner, and tower destruction. Immerse yourself in the world of toy soldiers who wage fierce battles for power and influence in the room. Bright dynamic battles, unique missions, and a variety of game modes await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/308adf6f9ff2a90beeea01029ce9aaac.poster.avif?t=1752324886\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/308adf6f9ff2a90beeea01029ce9aaac.webm?t=1752324886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/308adf6f9ff2a90beeea01029ce9aaac.mp4?t=1752324886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story campaign is divided into chapters, each offering distinct missions that challenge your skills across different aspects of the game. And if you're looking for some non-stop fun without the narrative, dive into the sandbox mode \u2014 where you can explore all game elements and compete for the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/e2dbd4db438b47d400ac345ff5666295.poster.avif?t=1752324886\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/e2dbd4db438b47d400ac345ff5666295.webm?t=1752324886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/e2dbd4db438b47d400ac345ff5666295.mp4?t=1752324886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your army of toys, crush your enemies' towers, and prove that even the smallest soldiers can become the greatest heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/d66ab97db8f1c3cb34b6e31ad688b2b2.poster.avif?t=1752324886\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/d66ab97db8f1c3cb34b6e31ad688b2b2.webm?t=1752324886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003640/extras/d66ab97db8f1c3cb34b6e31ad688b2b2.mp4?t=1752324886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Vibrant 3d graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Exciting and funny plot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Comic cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Different game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Author's musical accompaniment</p>",
